   "text": "carol → bits 2, 6, 9.   Bit 2 is 0 → “definitely NOT in the set”. Answer at once; no lookup needed.\nIf all k bits had been 1 → “probably in the set” (could be a false positive) → do the real lookup.",
   "originalText": "carol → bits 2, 6, 9.   Bit 2 is 0 → “definitely NOT in the set”. Answer at once; no lookup needed.\nIf all k bits had been 1 → “probably in the set” (could be a false positive) → do the real lookup.",
